            <ArticleTitle>Langerhans cell histiocytosis in an adult.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>52-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.bjoms.2008.04.010</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe an unusual case of a 31-year-old man who presented with generalised pain in his jaw after referral by his general dental practitioner. Langerhans histiocytosis was diagnosed and treatment started with azathioprine.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
